  "title": "Praying for Others and Welcoming Them",
  "summary": "Paul estende um convite caloroso ao jovem, oferece oração de intercessão por cura emocional e o acolhe em uma comunidade de comunhão e hospitalidade.",
  "audio_url": "/audios/great-commission-04.mp3",
  "word_count_target": 140,
  "story_en": "Seeing peace return to the young man’s face, Paul gently places a hand on his shoulder. “Would you like me to pray for you right now?” Paul asks with care.\n\nThe young man nods gratefully. Paul bows his head in sincere intercession, asking God to bring emotional healing, deep comfort, and spiritual renewal into his new friend's heart. He speaks a blessing of divine peace and strength over his daily life.\n\nAfter their prayer, Paul invites him to join a small fellowship gathering of believers. “We share meals, read scripture, and practice open hospitality,” Paul explains. “You will find a safe family where people support each other through every trial.”\n\nFeeling the warmth of genuine community, the man accepts the invitation, knowing he has found a spiritual home.",
